<title>UK: CSFB sets call warrants on Credit Suisse.</title>
<headline>CSFB sets call warrants on Credit Suisse.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse First Boston said it has issued five million American-style call warrants on registered shares of Credit Suisse Group.</p>
<p>Five warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    165 CHF		   PREMIUM	10.3 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.08 CHF		  GEARING	15.3 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 18.MAR.97-30.JAN.98   PAYDATE	17.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  159 CHF --Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
